@MarketData = http://localhost:8082

### 1. USD -> TRY (200)
GET {{MarketData}}/api/market/fx?base=USD&symbol=TRY

### 2. lower case is accepted (200, EUR/USD)
GET {{MarketData}}/api/market/fx?base=eur&symbol=usd

### 3. bad code: rejected before any outside call (400)
GET {{MarketData}}/api/market/fx?base=US1&symbol=TRY

### 4. unknown currency: the provider answers 404, not retried (400)
GET {{MarketData}}/api/market/fx?base=USD&symbol=XYZ

### 5. circuit breaker state (CLOSED / OPEN / HALF_OPEN) inside health
GET {{MarketData}}/actuator/health

### 6. circuit breaker details
GET {{MarketData}}/actuator/circuitbreakers
